{"ut":"/allasajanlat-sopron-recepcios","kulcs":"allasajanlat-sopron-recepcios","cim":"Állásajánlataink","leiras":"Cím: XIII. kerület, Újpesti rakpart 7. - A Jászai Mari térnél.","tipus":"oldal","szekciok":[{"id":"comp-lvxjcysy","y":112,"h":2076,"bgSzin":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)","bgKep":"","hatterElhagyva":0,"horgonyok":[],"fa":{"t":"verem","k":[{"t":"h","n":2,"html":"Recepciós állás - Sopron","fs":50,"fw":400,"kozep":true,"panel":"","y":119,"x":230,"w":977,"h":70},{"t":"kep","src":"/assets/img/f18724_93808e5f80234856ad4add6a07bb7705.webp","alt":"mp-recepcios.jpg","link":"","bg":false,"nw":1000,"nh":667,"panel":"","y":200,"x":410,"w":619,"h":368},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"<strong>Mosolygós, pörgős és jó problémamegoldó. Lehet, hogy te leszel a Medical Piercing soproni szalonjának recepciósa? :)</strong>","fs":14,"fw":400,"kozep":true,"panel":"","y":575,"x":410,"w":619,"h":39},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"Ha mosolygós, kedves Hölgy vagy és a személyes- / telefonos kommunikáció mellett az adminisztráció és az írás sem áll távol tőled, akkor Téged keresünk a csapatba","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":662,"x":403,"w":600,"h":71},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"<strong>Mivel foglalkozunk?</strong>","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":757,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"A Medical Piercing egy közérzetjavító piercingekre specializálódott szalon. Budapesti skerünk után most már új <strong>Soproni szalonunkban</strong> segítünk a vendégeinknek egy nyugodtabb, kiegyensúlyozottabb fájdalommentes életet élni.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":805,"x":403,"w":600,"h":95},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"<strong>Amit kínálunk:</strong>","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":924,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Bejelentett, heti 5 napos stabil munkaviszony.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":971,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Gyönyörű, hangulatos, tiszta munkahely.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":995,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Szeretetteljes, segítőkész légkör.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1019,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Válogatott vendégkör.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1043,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Előrelépési lehetőség.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1067,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Hosszútávú karrier.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1090,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"<strong>Amit elvárunk:</strong>","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1138,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Front office / ügyfélszolgálati tapasztalat.<br>\n<strong>- Német nyelvtudás</strong>","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1186,"x":403,"w":600,"h":48},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Telefonálási tapasztalat.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1233,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- MS Excel alap szintű ismerete.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1257,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Canva (vagy bármilyen képszerkesztő) haladó ismerete.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1281,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Facebook / Instagram kezelési tapasztalat.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1305,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Nyílt személyiség.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1328,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Jó kommunikációs készség.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1352,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- Segítőkészség, pontosság, felelősségvállalás.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1376,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- És persze mosolyogj és szeresd az embereket!","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1400,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"<strong>Ez lesz a dolgod:</strong>","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1471,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"Te fogadod majd a vendégeinket a szalonban, kitöltteted velük a kezelési lapot, menedzseled az időpontfoglalásokat, a beosztásokat, a lemondásokat. Válaszolsz a bejövő e-mailekre és üzenetekre. Ez egy nagyon bizalmi munkakör, mert rád bízzuk a kasszakezelést, az eszközök rendelését, illetve a Facebook és Insta oldalunk kezelése is a te kezedben lesz.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1519,"x":403,"w":600,"h":119},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"A telefonálási tapasztalat pedig azért szükséges mert fontosnak tartjuk, hogy törődjünk a vendégeinkkel, ezért minden héten felhívod majd az adott heti vendégeket és visszajelzést kérsz tőlük","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1662,"x":403,"w":600,"h":71},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"Nem fogsz unatkozni, egy igazi pörgős munkaköröd lesz, egy mégis nagyon nyugis és letisztult szalonban, ami erős fejlődési pályán van.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1757,"x":403,"w":600,"h":48},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"Stabil, bejelentett munkahelyet biztosítunk neked, és az érzést, hogy szükség van rád és a munkádra, cserébe viszont azt várjuk, hogy számíthassunk rád a szalon vezetésében és a vendégek kezelésében.","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1828,"x":403,"w":600,"h":71},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"<strong>Beszélgessünk a munkáról?</strong>","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1923,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"Akkor várjuk:","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1971,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- fényképes önéletrajzod (a bérigényed megjelölésével)","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":1995,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"- és motivációs leveled a:","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":2019,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"<a href=\"mailto:medicalpiercing.hu@gmail.com?subject=%C3%9Aj%20jelentkez%C5%91%20-%20Sopron%20-%20Recepci%C3%B3s\">medicalpiercing.hu@gmail.com</a> e-mail címre!","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":2066,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"Vagy ezen az oldalon A lenti űrlap kitöltésével is tudsz jelentkezni:","fs":17,"fw":400,"kozep":false,"panel":"","y":2114,"x":403,"w":600,"h":24}]}},{"id":"comp-lvxjcyu82","y":2188,"h":834,"bgSzin":"rgba(232, 230, 230, 0.8)","bgKep":"/assets/img/f18724_4c255ccc73644dd69f9025abea06c4b4.webp","hatterElhagyva":0,"horgonyok":[],"fa":{"t":"sor","k":[{"t":"kep","src":"/assets/img/f18724_4c255ccc73644dd69f9025abea06c4b4.webp","alt":"hatter2.png","link":"","bg":true,"nw":1000,"nh":1000,"panel":"","y":2248,"x":60,"w":103,"h":714},{"t":"verem","k":[{"t":"h","n":2,"html":"Jelentkeznélaz állásra?","fs":49,"fw":400,"kozep":true,"panel":"","y":2329,"x":169,"w":317,"h":137},{"t":"p","n":0,"html":"Ezzel az űrlappal tudsz.","fs":20,"fw":400,"kozep":true,"panel":"","y":2557,"x":169,"w":317,"h":25}]},{"t":"urlap","mezok":[{"tag":"input","tipus":"text","cimke":"Vezetéknév","kotelezo":true,"nev":"vezetéknév"},{"tag":"input","tipus":"text","cimke":"Keresztnév","kotelezo":true,"nev":"keresztnév"},{"tag":"input","tipus":"date","cimke":"Születési idő","kotelezo":true,"nev":""},{"tag":"input","tipus":"email","cimke":"E-mail cím","kotelezo":true,"nev":"email"},{"tag":"input","tipus":"tel","cimke":"Telefonszám:","kotelezo":true,"nev":"phone"},{"tag":"input","tipus":"number","cimke":"Nettó bérigény","kotelezo":true,"nev":"nettó-bérigény"},{"tag":"input","tipus":"text","cimke":"Előző munkahely neve:","kotelezo":true,"nev":"előző-munkahely neve:"},{"tag":"input","tipus":"number","cimke":"Tapasztalati évek száma:","kotelezo":true,"nev":"tapasztalati-évek száma:"},{"tag":"input","tipus":"file","cimke":"Önéletrajz feltöltés","kotelezo":false,"nev":""},{"tag":"input","tipus":"file","cimke":"Motivációs levél feltöltés","kotelezo":false,"nev":""}],"kuld":"","id":"comp-lvxjcyuv","y":2255,"x":754,"w":456,"h":692}]}},{"id":"comp-